hat her passport was safely inside her travel bag.","example_zh":"她確認護照已安全放在旅行袋裡。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/passport-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-patent-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"patent","sort_order":1,"sense":"專利","alt_zh":"成年女發明家在明亮工作室展示節水裝置與帶封印的專利證書，文字不可辨識。","example":"The inventor received a patent for her new water-saving device.","example_zh":"發明家為新型節水裝置取得專利。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/patent-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pathogen-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pathogen","sort_order":1,"sense":"病原體","alt_zh":"高中生聽老師介紹展示櫃中病原微生物的放大模型，無培養操作或感染病人。","example":"The biology exhibit showed a magnified model of a pathogen.","example_zh":"生物展覽展示病原體的放大模型。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pathogen-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-patriotism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"patriotism","sort_order":1,"sense":"愛國心","alt_zh":"社區成年志工與高中生共同整理本國歷史建築的庭院，無國旗文字。","example":"Their patriotism inspired them to help restore the country's historic buildings.","example_zh":"愛國心鼓舞他們協助修復國家的歷史建築。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/patriotism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-patronage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"patronage","sort_order":1,"sense":"贊助","alt_zh":"成年畫家在工作室向基金會代表展示完成畫作，代表友善支持。","example":"The painter continued her work with the patronage of a local foundation.","example_zh":"畫家獲得當地基金會贊助，得以持續創作。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/patronage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-peacekeeping-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"peacekeeping","sort_order":1,"sense":"維和","alt_zh":"博物館模型中，戴藍色頭盔的成年維和人員協助居民修復橋梁，無武器戰鬥。","example":"The exhibit described peacekeeping efforts that helped communities rebuild.","example_zh":"展覽介紹協助社區重建的維和行動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/peacekeeping-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-peasant-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"peasant","sort_order":1,"sense":"農民","alt_zh":"博物館歷史畫作描繪衣著樸素的成年農民在小田地照料作物。","example":"The historical painting showed a peasant tending a small field.","example_zh":"歷史畫作呈現一位農民照料小田地。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/peasant-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pedagogy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pedagogy","sort_order":1,"sense":"教學法","alt_zh":"成年教師在研習工作坊交流如何使用模型與實驗教具教學。","example":"The workshop explored a pedagogy based on hands-on experiments.","example_zh":"工作坊探討以實作實驗為基礎的教學法。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pedagogy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pedestrian-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pedestrian","sort_order":1,"sense":"行人","alt_zh":"成年行人在行人穿越道前等候，車輛停妥、行人號誌顯示安全通行。","example":"The pedestrian waited until the crossing was safe.","example_zh":"那位行人等到可以安全通行才過馬路。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pedestrian-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-penicillin-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"penicillin","sort_order":1,"sense":"盤尼西林","alt_zh":"高中生參觀歷史科學展，展示早期實驗室模型與封閉培養皿，無藥物劑量或實驗步驟。","example":"The science exhibit explained the discovery of penicillin.","example_zh":"科學展覽介紹盤尼西林的發現。","imag