les move the arm.","example_zh":"生理學課程探討肌肉如何使手臂活動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/physiology-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pilgrimage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pilgrimage","sort_order":1,"sense":"朝聖","alt_zh":"成年朝聖者沿安全山徑莊重前往古老聖殿，氣氛寧靜尊重。","example":"The travelers made a pilgrimage to a sacred mountain shrine.","example_zh":"旅人前往神聖的山間聖地朝聖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pilgrimage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pinnacle-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pinnacle","sort_order":1,"sense":"頂峰","alt_zh":"高中健行隊在有護欄的觀景臺仰望遠方尖銳山峰。","example":"The climbers admired the rocky pinnacle from a safe viewpoint.","example_zh":"登山者從安全觀景點欣賞岩石尖峰。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pinnacle-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-plaintiff-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"plaintiff","sort_order":1,"sense":"原告","alt_zh":"成年女性原告在法庭向成年法官提交文件，律師在旁，文字不可辨識。","example":"The plaintiff presented documents to support her claim.","example_zh":"原告提出文件支持她的主張。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/plaintiff-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-plantation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"plantation","sort_order":1,"sense":"種植園","alt_zh":"高中生與成年導覽員沿安全茶園步道行走，四周是整齊茶樹。","example":"The students visited a tea plantation on the hillside.","example_zh":"學生參觀山坡上的茶葉種植園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/plantation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-platform-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"platform","sort_orde