，入口有黑白肖像與花束，無文字。","example":"The museum organized a posthumous exhibition of the artist's paintings.","example_zh":"藝術家逝世後，博物館為她舉辦遺作展。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/posthumous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-postulate-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"postulate","sort_order":1,"sense":"假設","alt_zh":"成年考古研究員在工作桌並排比對兩片相似陶瓷碎片與花瓶輪廓。","example":"The researchers postulate that the two fragments came from the same vase.","example_zh":"研究者假設，兩塊碎片來自同一個花瓶。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/postulate-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-potency-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"potency","sort_order":1,"sense":"效力；強度","alt_zh":"高中生在美術課把極少深色顏料混入一大碗白色顏料，老師在旁。","example":"The dark pigment's potency meant that only a tiny amount changed the whole mixture.","example_zh":"深色顏料的著色力很強，一點點就改變整碗混合物的顏色。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/potency-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-pragmatism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"pragmatism","sort_order":1,"sense":"實用主義；務實態度","alt_zh":"高中生與老師在工坊實際修復舊桌腳，旁邊可見修好的穩固桌子。","example":"Her pragmatism led the team to repair the old tables instead of buying new ones.","example_zh":"她的務實態度讓團隊選擇修理舊桌子，而非購買新桌。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/pragmatism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-preamble-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"preamble","sort_order":1,"sense":"序言","alt_zh":"高中生圍桌閱讀文件開頭部分，老師指著第一頁，文字不可辨識。","example":"We read the preamble before discussing the agreement's main rules.","example_zh":"我們先讀序言，再討論協議的主要規則。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/o