"成年園丁與高中志工在天色將轉陰的花園替幼樹固定支架。","example":"The gardeners took preemptive action by supporting the young trees before the storm.","example_zh":"園丁在暴風雨前支撐幼樹，預先防範損害。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/preemptive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prerogative-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prerogative","sort_order":1,"sense":"特權；專屬職權","alt_zh":"成年專案負責人在會議桌前從幾個建築模型選定一個，團隊認真聽取決定。","example":"Choosing the final design was the project leader's prerogative.","example_zh":"選擇最終設計是專案負責人的職權。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prerogative-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-presidency-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"presidency","sort_order":1,"sense":"總統任期","alt_zh":"歷史檔案館展示虛構成年女總統任內主持會議、訪問社區的照片，無真實政治人物。","example":"The archive displayed photographs from her presidency.","example_zh":"檔案館展出她擔任總統期間的照片。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/presidency-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-presumably-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"presumably","sort_order":1,"sense":"大概","alt_zh":"門邊一雙沾泥工作靴，窗外成年園丁正照料花圃，高中訪客留意靴子。","example":"The muddy boots presumably belonged to the gardener working outside.","example_zh":"那雙沾泥靴子大概屬於正在外面工作的園丁。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/presumably-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prevalence-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prevalence","sort_order":1,"sense":"盛行；普遍程度","alt_zh":"高中生在學校自行車停放區進行交通習慣調查，圖表只有無字自行車圖示。","example":"The survey measured the prevalence of bicycle use among local students.","example_zh":"調查測量當地學生騎自行車的普遍程度。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prevalence-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-privatization-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"privatization","sort_order":1,"sense":"私有化","alt_zh":"老師用工廠模型與所有權文件，向高中生客觀解說從政府經營轉交私人公司的過程，無文字。","example":"The lesson examined the privatization of a state-owned factory.","example_zh":"課程探討國營工廠的私有化。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/privatization-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-probation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"probation","sort_order":1,"sense":"緩刑","alt_zh":"成年法官在法庭向成年當事人與緩刑監督員說明裁決，場景平靜無束縛。","example":"The judge placed the offender on probation under supervision.","example_zh":"法官判處違法者接受監督下的緩刑。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/probation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-procurement-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"procurement","sort_order":1,"sense":"採購","alt_zh":"成年學校行政人員在會議桌比較幾家供應商的書籍樣本與無字清單。","example":"The school improved its procurement of books by comparing several suppliers.","example_zh":"學校比較多家供應商，改善書籍採購。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/procurement-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prodigy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prodigy","sort_order":1,"sense":"神童","alt_zh":"穿整齊學校服裝的年輕棋手自信思考棋盤，成年教練讚賞地觀察。","example":"The young chess prodigy solved the difficult puzzle in moments.","example_zh":"年輕西洋棋神童片刻間解開困難棋題。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prodigy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-proficiency-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"proficiency","sort_order":1,"sense":"熟練","alt_zh":"高中女生向老師展示精準平滑的木製盒榫接，工具整齊收好。","example":"Her proficiency in woodworking showed in the smooth, precise joints.","example_zh":"平滑精準的接合處展現她熟練的木工技術。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/proficiency-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prognosis-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prognosis","sort_order":1,"sense":"預後","alt_zh":"成年醫師在安靜診間與成年病人耐心交談，桌上是無字醫療資料，無治療建議。","example":"The doctor discussed the patient's prognosis with care and honesty.","example_zh":"醫師謹慎而坦誠地說明病人的預後。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prognosis-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-proliferation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"proliferation","sort_order":1,"sense":"擴散；大量增生","alt_zh":"高中生與生態老師在有護欄的池塘步道觀察大量綠色藻類。","example":"The warm weather encouraged the proliferation of algae in the pond.","example_zh":"溫暖天氣促使池塘藻類大量增生。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/proliferation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prophecy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prophecy","sort_order":1,"sense":"預言","alt_zh":"高中生在圖書館聽故事，桌上古老無字繪本描繪未來連接兩村的橋。","example":"The old story contained a prophecy about a bridge joining the two villages.","example_zh":"古老故事中有一則預言，說一座橋將連接兩個村莊。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prophecy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-proposition-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"proposition","sort_order":1,"sense":"提議","alt_zh":"高中女生向學生會展示庭院改建為閱讀花園的模型，同學認真聽取提議。","example":"Her proposition was to turn the unused courtyard into a reading garden.","example_zh":"她提議把閒置庭院改造成閱讀花園。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/proposition-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-proprietor-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"proprietor","sort_order":1,"sense":"業主","alt_zh":"成年書店老闆在溫暖書店入口微笑迎接高中生。","example":"The bookstore proprietor welcomed the students to the reading event.","example_zh":"書店業主歡迎學生參加閱讀活動。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/proprietor-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prosecution-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prosecution","sort_order":1,"sense":"起訴；起訴方","alt_zh":"成年檢察官在法庭向法官展示封存文件，氣氛客觀莊重，無犯罪畫面。","example":"The prosecution presented evidence during the trial.","example_zh":"起訴方在審判中提出證據。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prosecution-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-protocol-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"protocol","sort_order":1,"sense":"協議","alt_zh":"兩組成年研究員在會議桌確認共享資料流程文件，旁邊電腦顯示無字資料夾圖示。","example":"The teams agreed on a protocol for sharing their research data.","example_zh":"各團隊就分享研究資料的協議達成共識。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/protocol-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-prototype-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"prototype","sort_order":1,"sense":"原型","alt_zh":"高中生在老師旁測試桌上透明雨水收集器初步模型，以灑水壺模擬下雨。","example":"The students tested a prototype of their rainwater collector.","example_zh":"學生測試雨水收集器的原型。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/prototype-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-provenance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"provenance","sort_order":1,"sense":"來源","alt_zh":"成年策展人戴手套查看古陶碗、老照片與收藏紀錄，文字不可辨識。","example":"The curator investigated 