ation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"publication","sort_order":1,"sense":"出版物","alt_zh":"高中生與圖書館員一起翻閱有本地野生動物插圖的新書。","example":"The library added a new publication about local wildlife.","example_zh":"圖書館新增一本介紹當地野生動物的出版物。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/publication-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-purification-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"purification","sort_order":1,"sense":"淨化","alt_zh":"高中生在老師監督下觀察透明多層濾材教具，混濁水變清，無飲用或安全宣稱。","example":"The model demonstrated water purification using layers of filter material.","example_zh":"模型展示利用多層濾材進行水的淨化。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/purification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-quarantine-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"quarantine","sort_order":1,"sense":"隔離","alt_zh":"園藝師將新到盆栽放入與主溫室分開的獨立隔離區，學生從外面觀察。","example":"The newly arrived plants stayed in quarantine before entering the greenhouse.","example_zh":"新到的植物進溫室前先接受隔離。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/quarantine-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-quota-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"quota","sort_order":1,"sense":"配額","alt_zh":"老師把相同數量木棒與繩索分給幾組高中生，每組材料整齊等量。","example":"Each group received the same quota of materials for the bridge challenge.","example_zh":"每組獲得相同配額的材料，參加模型橋挑戰。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/quota-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-quotation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"quotation","sort_order":1,"sense":"引述","alt_zh":"高中女生在文學課指著詩集的一小段，與同學討論，文字不可辨識。","example":"She used a short quotation from the poem to support her interpretation.","example_zh":"她引用詩中的短句，支持自己的詮釋。